  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Cook the garlic rice\n• Finely chop garlic.\n• In a medium saucepan, melt half the butter with a dash of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook half the garlic until fragrant, 1 minute. Add the water (for the rice) and a generous pinch of salt, stir, then bring to the boil.\n• Add jasmine rice, then reduce heat to low and cover with a lid. Cook for 10 minutes, then remove from heat and keep covered until the rice is tender and the water is absorbed, 10 minutes. TIP: The rice will finish cooking in its own steam, so don't peek!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66ebbe3f8e45e3ca00863245-e4d8e317.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the rice is cooking, roughly chop capsicum.\n• Drain and rinse black beans.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66ebbe3f8e45e3ca00863245-4a672d77.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Stir-fry capsicum, mild Caribbean jerk seasoning, tomato paste and remaining garlic until fragrant, 2-3 minutes.\n• Stir in the water (for the sauce), coconut milk, black beans and vegetable stock pot (see ingredients). Simmer until thickened, 2-4 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66ebbe3f8e45e3ca00863245-ba2216b9.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the chilli is simmering, roughly chop tomato and coriander.\n• Thinly slice spring onion.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66ebbe3f8e45e3ca00863245-37c1417b.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a medium bowl, combine a drizzle of the white wine vinegar and olive oil. Season with salt and pepper.\n• Add tomato, coriander and spring onion, tossing to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66ebbe3f8e45e3ca00863245-644ad5fe.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide garlic rice and Caribbean black bean chilli between bowls.\n• Top with tomatosalsa and a dollop of light sour cream.\n• Sprinkle over Cheddar cheese to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66ebbe3f8e45e3ca00863245-a3368baf.jpeg"
    }
  ]
